Main type: the customer wants the airbag light repair covered by warranty and asks to open a claim, so warranty_claim. Secondary: recall_inquiry (asks if the recall applies) and billing_dispute (refuses to pay the $2,078). 

Escalation: an airbag warning light with no failure is not a safety escalation. Is the charge being contested and wanting it removed? "I am NOT PAYING" contests the charge, so policy_limit applies. Not adversarial: firmly asking for coverage is explicitly allowed. Not needs_human, because there is no legal threat or request for a person.

